            	</R-PORT-PROTOTYPE>
«ENDFOREACH-»
«FOREACH sum_Ssfm_Channel.select(e|e.sum_Ssfm_Channel_ID_Ref!=null) AS CHANNEL_REF ITERATOR i-»
