«FOREACH sum_Ssfm_ConfigSet.sum_Ssfm_ErrorsHandlers.sum_Ssfm_Errh_BswError.sum_Ssfm_EventIdForSettingDTC_ref AS BSW_ERROR-»
«IF BSW_ERROR != null -»
