«ENDFOREACH-»
«FOREACH Ssfm_Get_InvalidLINDemEvents(sum_Ssfm_ConfigSet.sum_Ssfm_GroupInfo.sum_Ssfm_LINInfo) AS DemEvent-»
				<R-PORT-PROTOTYPE>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RP_Dem_SSFM_FaultIndication_LIN_«DemEvent.shortName»</SHORT-NAME>
