«IF Ssfm_NumOfLNMSlaveInfoError(sum_Ssfm_ConfigSet, "SSFM_LNM_RESPONDER_IEF") > 0-»
«FOREACH Ssfm_Get_LNMError_LinSlaveInfo(sum_Ssfm_ConfigSet, "SSFM_LNM_RESPONDER_IEF") AS SlaveInfoError-»
                <R-PORT-PROTOTYPE>
