«FOREACH Ssfm_GetLinIefDemEvents(sum_Ssfm_ConfigSet.sum_Ssfm_ErrorsHandlers.sum_Ssfm_Errh_LNMErrors.sum_Ssfm_LNM_ResponderInfoError) AS DemEvent-»
